          "color": "ink",
          "align": "justify",
          "cols": 1,
          "text": "At its core is a physical structure made of four spiraling steel columns that are held together in dynamic balance. Each 6 meter tall column rotates gradually from the base and is imbricated with patterns of emergent life-processes.\n\nThe work invites you to examine the site through these perforations, pondering our relationships with the self, the other and the cosmos at large.\n\nYou can explore interactive interpretations of the site and its themes, read more about the structure and its construction, see upcoming events, or find out about the team that built the project.",
